Description: Linux driver and theme editor for Thermalright Trofeo LCD
 Open Trofeo LCD is a reverse-engineered Linux driver, backend and Qt theme
 editor for the Thermalright Trofeo LCD cooler display.
 .
 This development preview package uses the native PyUSB display backend by
 default. TRCC remains an optional acceleration path until it is available as a
 distro package.
